"reflection": "St. Peter says something astonishing: we are called to share in the very life of God. The Fathers distinguished God's essence, which no creature can grasp, from His energies, His grace and light, which He truly gives. We never become God by nature, but by grace we are drawn into His life. Every prayer, every kindness, every Communion is a step on that road.",
